name: invisible-units
displayName: Invisible Units
author: Aewsomn
description: "Makes Mono, Poly, and Mega fully transparent - bodies, cells, outlines, shadows and wings included. Adds an 'Invisible Units' category to the game's Settings menu with a toggle to flip them between normal and completely invisible at any time, no restart needed."
